Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,sign_Arial,text (top section),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HCECECE&\bord0\shad0\fs12\pos(321,94)}This is a work of fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,sign_Arial,text (2nd section),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HCECECE&\bord0\shad0\fs12\pos(319,142)\q2}Forex (foreign exchange margin trading) is a high-risk venture, and it's possible for losses to exceed margin payments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,sign_Arial,text (3rd section),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HCECECE&\bord0\shad0\fs11\q2\pos(316,193)}There is a risk that excessive trading can interfere with one's daily life, so please think it over carefully and proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,sign_Arial,text (4th section),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HCECECE&\bord5\shad0\fs8\q2\pos(318,242)}The story contains depictions of foreign forex brokers and high-leverage transactions not in accordance with Japanese law,\N but there is risk involved in trading with parties not registered with the Financial Services Agency. Please do not attempt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,sign_Arial,text (bottom section),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HCECECE&\bord5\shad0\fs8\q2\pos(316,309)}Furthermore, when actually engaging in trading, read all pre-contractual documentation carefully.\N Once you understand the contents therein, please be aware that engaging in forex trading is your own decision, and you assume total responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:09.57,sign_Arial,text (top line),0,0,0,,{\pos(365,65)\3c&H6526EA&\shad0\fs8}Unveiling of New Terminals Postponed - Supply Chain Delays Could Be the Cause
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:09.57,sign_Arial,text (2nd line),0,0,0,,{\3c&H6526EA&\shad0\fs8\pos(366,107)}Popular Chain Reduces Late Night Hours - Labor Shortage Intensifies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:09.57,italics,newscaster,0,0,0,,We now move on to our next segment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:11.57,italics,hostess,0,0,0,,It's your morning zodiac rankings!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:13.83,italics,hostess,0,0,0,,Today's best luck belongs to...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:15.77,italics,hostess,0,0,0,,all you Pisces!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:17.29,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:23.29,sign_Verdana,text (blue),0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&HFBA858&\shad0\fs30\bord4}Today's 12 Zodiac Rankings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:23.29,sign_Verdana,text (gold),0,0,0,,{\pos(144,115)\c&H4F9BB3&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\shad0f\fs25}1st Place: Pisces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:23.29,sign_Verdana,text (2nd),0,0,0,,{\an9\i1\c&HF8CCDD&\3c&H995D65&\bord3\shad0\pos(602,93)\fs15}2nd Place: Taurus\N 3rd Place: Gemini\N 4th Place: Leo\N 5th Place: Cancer\N 6th Place: Scorpio\N 7th Place: Aries\N 8th Place: Virgo\N 9th Place: Capricorn\N 10th Place: Libra\N 11th Place: Sagittarius\N{\c&HC69098&\3c&H832827&} 12th Place: Aquarius
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.29,0:00:20.25,italics,hostess,0,0,0,,I think there's a big \Nopportunity coming your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:23.29,italics,hostess,0,0,0,,Your lucky item is... a bracelet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:26.15,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Bracelet, my butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:30.71,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,At this point, I'll rely on anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:35.43,main,,0,0,0,,Time to begin Operation: Living \NExpenses Full Power Deposit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:40.06,sign_Arial,text (left side),0,0,0,,{\c&H4E4B54&\3c&HF6F6F6&\shad0\bord4\frz32.01\pos(74,147)}Deposit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:40.06,sign_Arial,text (right side; next to slider),0,0,0,,{\c&H494552&\bord0\shad0\fs15\pos(500,125)\frx38\fry356}Post-Trade Balance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:40.06,sign_Arial,text (right side; bottom left),0,0,0,,{\c&H39363F&\bord0\shad0\fs15\frx34\fry344\pos(340,224)}Foreign Account
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:40.06,sign_Arial,text (right side; bottom right),0,0,0,,{\c&H383341&\bord0\shad0\frx44\fry354\pos(593,222)}yen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:40.06,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'll deposit all my monthly \Nstudent aid into my forex account.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:43.81,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,That'll raise my dead line, \Nand I'll be able to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.09,0:00:45.87,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I can get by on one meal a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.69,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,As long as I have tap water \Nand bread crusts, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.69,0:00:53.32,sign_Arial,text (red boxes),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H06003C&\bord4}Ramen\N{\c&H3A4D58&\3c&H043850&}Sukiyaki Fixings\N{\c&H251828&\3c&H605C63&} Seafood Gratin\N{\c&H76676B&\3c&H0D2450&} Spring Curry\N{\c&H6B6370&\3c&H363C67&}Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.69,0:00:53.32,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,If I mix in the food they sometimes \Nsend from home, that'll cover nutrition!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.32,0:00:55.58,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's an iron wall defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:00.47,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.71,0:01:04.46,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40\c&H444D54&\bord0\shad0}Iron wall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.47,0:01:04.46,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's a surefire way to win, so \Nlong as I'm not force-liquidated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:08.01,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,{\i0}This{\i1} is my unbeatable plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:44.44,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,This strategy was supposed to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:46.50,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:48.68,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I thought I'd made it foolproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:51.94,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:56.45,sign_Arial,text (right),0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&H77904D&\shad0\frz-9.6\pos(500,101)\c&HBABFAD&\bord0\fs12}Account Balance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:54.44,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Even if I deposit a hundred \Nthousand yen each month,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:56.45,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I can only extend my life by 0.5 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:03:00.62,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,But it's already gone up \Nnearly four yen in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:03.51,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,At this pace, the deposits won't keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:05.60,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I don't have enough money at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:07.50,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'm screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:20.19,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Ten yen... No, one yen apiece \Nwould be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.19,0:03:24.04,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,If everyone in Japan donated \Nthat much, I'd get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:27.77,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Why can't you do that in this country?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:33.69,sign_Arial,text (green),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H6C8A79&\bord0\shad0\move(100,59,100,44,1,146)\fad(146,1)}Incoming Message
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:33.69,sign_Arial,text (white),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs12\move(170,145,170,135,1,146)\c&H6C8A79&\bord0\shad0\fad(146,1)}Long time no talk!\NSchool starts soon, but before that, you want to hang out\Nand compare notes on where we are so far with the Forex Investment(?) Battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:41.41,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Oh, these? I came up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:45.03,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Wow, you made those \Nbarrettes yourself too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.03,0:03:46.10,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:50.50,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I even tried selling them online, \Nbut that went nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:54.25,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,How do you expect to sell merch \Nwhen there's no brand strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:55.74,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.74,0:03:58.80,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,That's why I've decided \Nto try drawing manga next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:00.70,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I'll make it more popular on social media,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.70,0:04:02.76,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,and maybe sell it at COMITIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:05.10,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Hmm, well, sounds like \Nit'd be worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.10,0:04:09.23,sign_Arial,text (green; left),0,0,0,,{\an4\c&H231D43&\3c&H3D4B3C&\shad0}Duck Onion Ramen\N {\c&H1E1115&\3c&HA18489&}Seafood Gratin\N {\c&H110A10&\3c&H3E4370&}Sukiyaki Fixings
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:09.23,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Normally, at a time like this, \NI'd offer some sweets, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:08.82,top,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I'm sure you \Ncan do it, Yasuko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:12.15,top,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks! Sure, I'll give it a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.23,0:04:13.36,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,But nope! Sorry, \Nit's all my emergency food!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:17.44,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Here's tea for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:18.66,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:20.82,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I was waiting for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.70,italics,Mebuki (to herself),0,0,0,,Think again, Yasuko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:31.35,italics,Mebuki (to herself),0,0,0,,You better not expect sweets \Nevery time you come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.73,0:04:33.88,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Let's get down to business, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:37.63,sign_ComicSansMS,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H363636&\3c&HFCFAFA&\shad0\bord4\fs15}giraffe\N{\c&HCB182F&\fs20} Investment Battle Rules\N{\c&H514F4F&\gs15} by Kurumi
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:34.98,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:37.63,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I made some rules \Nfor the investor battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:38.80,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:41.33,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,It's true, we never really settled on any.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.33,0:04:44.20,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Mebuki, you need to hear this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:46.22,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I've got no time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.10,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It's just simple agreements.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:51.56,sign_ComicSansMS,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(86,37)\shad0\c&H414141&\3c&HFFFFFF&}giraffe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:51.56,sign_ComicSansMS,text (blue),0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&HEE2D42&\3c&HFAFAFA&\bord4\pos(226,195)}Investment Battle Rules
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:51.56,sign_ComicSansMS,text (under blue),0,0,0,,{\pos(444,230)\c&H171717&\3c&HCFCFCF&\shad0}by Kurumi
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:51.56,sign_ComicSansMS,text (1),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs15\pos(138,258)\c&H161616&\shad0\bord0}Starting now in September, until 12/25.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:49.73,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,, Number one, the term!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.73,0:04:51.56,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Until this upcoming Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:53.48,main,,0,0,0,,Number two, the outcome.
