Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:55.88,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,We'll compete based on what percentage \Nyour forex account increases
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:58.11,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,from the starting point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.11,0:05:01.79,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Then, whoever wins the most can \Ntreat the rest of us to a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.79,0:05:02.75,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:04.26,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,You mean, any kind of food?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:06.01,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Even ramen topped with roast pork?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:07.77,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Or fancy seafood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:09.31,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Yep, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:10.96,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,You hear that, Mebuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:13.44,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,We get to eat on someone else's tab!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:15.71,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds good.
