Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:18.09,sign_Arial,text (3rd line),0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\bord0\frz-10.5\fax-0.02\pos(230,97)\fs15}Margin:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:18.09,sign_Arial,text (4th line),0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\bord0\frz-10.5\fax-0.02\pos(248,120)\fs15}Free Margin
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:18.09,sign_Arial,text (5th line),0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\bord0\frz-10.5\fax-0.02\pos(286,148)\fs15}Margin Level (%)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:18.09,sign_Arial,text (6th line),0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\bord0\frz-10.5\fax-0.02\fs15\pos(171,145)}Position
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:18.09,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Negative 550,000 yen...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:22.34,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,If this goes up another yen, \NI'll lose 700,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:24.60,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It'll take more than \Nfree food to recoup that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.98,0:05:27.55,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,And why are they all \Nhaving such a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:30.06,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Am I the only one losing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:32.19,sign_ComicSansMS,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H4C4A4B&\3c&HF4F3F5&\shad0}Outcome: Not a competition of total money,\N but of rate of increase\N Yasuko: {\c&H434047&\3c&HD5D7ED&}1st place\N{\c&H4C4A4B&\3c&HF4F3F5&}Kurumi: 4th place\N Mebuki: 3rd place\N Mochiko: {\c&H434047&\3c&HD5D7ED&}2nd place
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:32.19,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Okay, that decides the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.79,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,If you win, you buy food for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.79,0:05:37.41,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,No worries. I'm losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:38.82,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Yasuko-chan is too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:42.17,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I'm at -7% from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:45.41,sign_Georgia,text (top),0,0,0,,{\fad(482,1)\an8}Forex account balance\N 71,052 yen (7.2% decrease)\N (Starting point: 76,573 yen)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:44.67,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I've lost five thousand yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:46.91,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I seriously can't win at forex.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:49.15,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,What a tiny-ass amount!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.15,0:05:51.33,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's practically a win!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:54.10,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,In that case, I'm losing the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:55.77,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Mochiko-senpai is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:06:00.79,top,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I'm down 10% from the start. \NI've lost 1,200,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:06:01.55,sign_Georgia,text (top),0,0,0,,{\fad(482,481)\pos(444,224)}Forex account balance\N 13,302,630 yen (10.7% increase)\N (Starting point: 12,014,110 yen)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:04.84,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,There's no point \Nin being honest about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.97,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Huh? Weren't you winning \Nuntil a few days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:10.37,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I was with the euro, then it crashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:12.45,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,How are you so calm about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:14.60,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,If that were me,\NI wouldn't get out of bed for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.95,0:06:16.76,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I'm used to cutting my losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.76,0:06:19.77,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,So, even Mochiko-senpai loses sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.77,0:06:21.07,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I feel a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:23.10,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Aren't you winning, Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:27.12,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Let's see. I haven't locked it in yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:29.45,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I might as well do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:31.66,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:40.64,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,You were still holding the \NUSD/JPY position from back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:43.22,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got greedy this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:47.76,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Then, just from this one time, \Nyou made about 1,500,000 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:48.85,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:52.19,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.19,0:06:56.60,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Kurumi-senpai did the exact opposite \Nof me, and went long on USD/JPY?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.66,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I'm over 70% up from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:07:01.86,sign_Georgia,text (top),0,0,0,,{\fad(482,1)\an8}Forex account balance\N 4,611,715 yen (73.5% increase)\N (Starting point: 2,656,690 yen)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:02.19,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,The gain this time was huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:07.16,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Then, if I had kept on imitating \NKurumi-senpai, I'd have been winning?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:10.15,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Th-That's so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:14.10,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I think we can assume Kurumi will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.83,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I might as well drop out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:18.11,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.11,0:07:20.50,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Oh, what about you, Mebuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:27.91,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,W-Well, look at it this way. \NAt least we both get a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:28.87,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.87,0:07:31.24,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,No, I'm going to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:34.85,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Right now, I've got \Nthe strongest position!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:38.18,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'll be the one who wins in the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:41.08,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:43.64,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Give it a rest, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:48.29,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:51.12,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,See you Monday at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:53.85,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I've got to head to work now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.85,0:07:55.54,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Do what you've gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:01.92,sign_ComicSansMS,text (note),0,0,0,,{\c&H262320&\3c&H776B63&\frz13.83\shad0\fs15\pos(300,36)}To Mebuki: Be sure you eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:15.32,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Huh, I guess not all parents suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:18.56,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you here late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:21.73,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I've actually got some \Nhorrible unrealized losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:24.81,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,That's bad, when you've \Ngot the strongest position.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.81,0:08:26.35,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,By how much are you in the red?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:33.65,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Five hundred thousand or so yen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.65,0:08:36.67,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,USD/JPY climbed, and you got burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:38.87,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Yes, scorched all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:43.35,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,A pig who's shorting USD/JPY right now? \NMore like the {\i0}weakest{\i1} position.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.86,0:08:45.95,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,But didn't you go from \Ntwo hundred thousand yen
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:48.66,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,to nearly seven hundred thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.66,0:08:52.34,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Th-The seven hundred thousand yen \Nis for next year's school expenses!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:55.99,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I lost it all on the pound, \Nthen I made a second deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.33,0:08:57.98,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,O-Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:08:59.49,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:02.23,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,This is turning into some \Ndelicious-looking roasted pork.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:03.57,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:05.72,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,What do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:10.80,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Come on, calm down. \NLet me tell you two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:15.23,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,First, you were right to add \Nyour school money as a deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.23,0:09:18.25,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Had you not, you wouldn't even \Nhave a chance of turning this around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.59,0:09:22.65,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Remember, even if you fail, \Nyour parents will pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.65,0:09:26.28,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,B-But my family isn't rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:29.46,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,You're their darling daughter. \NThey'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:31.97,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,If they're normal parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:34.14,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Here's the other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:35.96,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,USD/JPY will drop at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:37.51,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I-I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:39.21,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,How far will it fall?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:41.31,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Down to the one hundred yen range?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:43.10,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:46.11,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Not that I know when that will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.42,0:09:49.14,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I wasn't wrong after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:52.51,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,One more thing. \NShall I tell you, as a bonus?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:53.99,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I-I want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:55.67,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,This is special:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:10:01.16,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,The secret of how Kurumi made her \Nexplosive gains prior to meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:04.75,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Kurumi won trading AUD/JPY,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.44,0:10:07.50,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,and she borrowed money to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:09.67,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,She borrowed money?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:12.21,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,She really went that far?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:15.29,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I suspect she borrowed over a million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:18.43,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,She's quite the gambler, \Ngiven her sweet face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:22.69,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Gambling?! That means \Nshe won based solely on luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:36.70,sign_Arial,text (green),0,0,0,,{\c&H5E866E&\3c&H7AF5AA&\bord4\an7\shad0\pos(281,54)\fs9}I'm thinking of showing up for the lecture tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:36.70,sign_Arial,text (blue),0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&HBA7C76&\shad0\bord4\fs8\pos(325,125)}Today
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:36.70,sign_Arial,text (white),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H717171&\3c&HF7F7F7&\shad0\fs8\pos(207,202)}Taking another day off from school?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:39.57,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Ignore! No time for school right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:42.17,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Little miss Lady Luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:45.00,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I read through that {\i1}whole{\i0} book, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:47.62,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,You need more than luck in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.43,0:10:51.46,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,This is getting on my nerves!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:56.59,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (headline),0,0,0,,{\an8\fs30\c&H171619&\3c&HDCDFE2&\shad0\bord4}Financial Crisis\N{\fs15} Emergency-Measure Conference Held to Deal with Financial Crisis
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:59.09,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,No way can I go to a beauty parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:00.55,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I've got no money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:02.85,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:07.91,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I've heard that cutting your own hair \Ncan drive away bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:11.67,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.98,0:11:13.74,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,And next...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:25.94,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,By cleansing my body, \NI'll summon good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.41,0:11:31.50,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,So by now, USD/JPY should be dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:31.50,sign_Arial,text (white heading),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H6D6D6F&\3c&HF6F3F3&\shad0\pos(175,143)\fs8\fad(188,1)}Please select your account
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:34.72,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,110 yen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:36.72,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H38334A&\3c&H5F5797&\shad0\pos(104,196)\fs40\fax-0.13\frz24.04\frx350\fry16}Balance
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.72,0:11:38.51,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I was totally careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:40.53,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Th-Thirty thousand yen left to live...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.53,0:11:43.47,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,If it goes up another 0.1 yen, \Nit'll be forced liquidation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.64,0:11:48.31,flashback,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Remember, even if you fail, \Nyour parents will pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:51.23,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:55.44,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Start by calmly analyzing \Nwhy it's climbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:57.46,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,If I win, there's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:11:59.62,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,And I haven't lost yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.78,0:12:06.12,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Aha! It's rising because I'm watching it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:08.71,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll look away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:10.99,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It might actually be the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:12.66,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Now it should fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:16.77,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:19.38,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Way to take advantage of bad luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:24.19,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Uh-oh! I looked and now it's back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:25.72,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'll avert my eyes again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.43,0:12:28.44,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.69,0:12:30.19,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:31.82,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:38.70,sign_Georgia,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(319,299)}9 Hours Later
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:45.62,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Looking away... \Ndoesn't really mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.62,0:12:47.37,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'm just tiring myself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:54.04,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,USD/JPY dropped for seven hours, \Nand came right back up in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:57.51,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:02.26,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,stop already...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:07.18,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's going over 110 yen a second time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.23,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:26.02,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,USD/JPY will drop at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.67,0:13:44.02,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's dropping!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:45.72,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's still dropping!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:49.26,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,If I get through this, \NI'll be beyond saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:51.85,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Heaven's luck is finally upon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.85,0:13:54.73,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,God gave me this miracle crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:59.23,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let go \Nof this short position!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:07.33,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Thus, the rise in the USD/JPY market \Nfound its {\i1}temporary{\i0} ceiling this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:10.63,italics,narration,0,0,0,,at $1 = 110 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:23.84,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you at school lately. \NAre your grades okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.04,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:29.03,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,My grades'll be fine, \Nas long as you let me copy your notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:30.77,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.77,0:14:33.83,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're in a better mood, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.31,0:14:37.65,sign_Georgia,text (1st line),0,0,0,,{\an3\shad0\pos(605,188)\fs15\fad(2316,1)}Kurumi\N Forex account balance\N 3,611,715 yen\N (1,000,000 yen defrayed)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:39.48,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,So, Mochiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:43.07,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I set aside a million yen to cover taxes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.07,0:14:45.51,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,but I still think USD/JPY \Nhas room to rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:51.29,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I think geopolitical risk has waned,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:54.76,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,and once the dollar correction \Nfrom QE3 is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.83,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,maybe it'll finally climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:14:59.91,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I have no clue what she's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:01.95,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I bet she's making stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.95,0:15:05.25,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I view the recent USD/JPY \Ndrop as an adjustment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:08.41,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,But isn't this an appreciating yen \Nrather than a depreciating dollar?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.41,0:15:11.43,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Feels like the BOJ's monetary \Neasing is at its limit too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.43,0:15:14.34,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Hard to say which way \Nit'll play out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.11,0:15:17.12,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Mochiko-senpai's so smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:19.81,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I don't understand, but it sounds \Nlike she's pushing back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.13,0:15:24.27,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Well, I still think it's due for a rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:26.99,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Oh, I've got class starting soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:29.09,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.49,0:15:32.52,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Don't work {\i1}too{\i0} hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:39.76,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,If Kurumi-senpai wants to go long \Non USD/JPY, she's going to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.61,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.61,0:15:43.79,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Because she's used up all her luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.21,0:15:47.81,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,She's won too much so far, \Nall thanks to luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:52.41,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,In terms of probability, there's \Na strong chance she'll lose next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:55.69,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,And given all the bad luck I've had,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.69,0:15:58.85,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I think there's a strong chance \NI'll win big by being short.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:02.80,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,If you flip a coin ten times, and \Nit comes up heads ten times in a row,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:06.31,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,doesn't that raise the chances \Nyou'll get a series of tails?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:08.10,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's the same thing here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:19.17,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,How dumb can you get?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.57,0:16:21.74,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,She's talking at way too low a level.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.74,0:16:24.18,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,And she's totally wrong \Nabout probability theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:26.53,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,She managed to graduate \Nhigh school like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:30.59,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I'll admit that Kurumi's dumb luck is \Nexceptional, but to say it's {\i0}all{\i1} luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:32.97,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,She's not giving her enough credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:35.97,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,But I think I'll take this approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:39.11,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Right, I couldn't agree more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:44.86,sign_Arial,text (top left blue bg header),0,0,0,,{\an4\c&HFECFC5&\bord4\shad0\3c&HDA735B&\pos(161,37)}Daily News
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:44.86,sign_Arial,text (header; white bg),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H623B34&\3c&HF7F7F7&\shad0\fs8\pos(20,112)}[Indicators] Economic Indicator Federal Reserve Bank of New York's Manufacturing Report on Business
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:48.99,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I-It finally happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:50.61,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H26222C&\3c&H5F5797&\shad0\fs40\fax-0.13\frx350\fry16\pos(66,206)\frz20.68\bord0}Balance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:54.38,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'm back in the black. I'm safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:58.50,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Safe? What am I babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:02.22,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I stuck it out through those hellish days,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.22,0:17:05.05,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,and I have a few thousand yen \Nin profit to show for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:03.75,sign_Arial,text (top line),0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\bord0\frz-10.5\fax-0.02\fs15\pos(228,49)\c&HA99A98&}Balance:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:03.75,sign_Arial,text (2nd line),0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\bord0\frz-10.5\fax-0.02\fs15\pos(262,75)\c&HA99A98&}Equity:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:03.75,sign_Arial,text (3rd line),0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\bord0\frz-10.5\fax-0.02\fs15\pos(236,89)\c&HA99A98&}Margin:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:03.75,sign_Arial,text (4th line),0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\bord0\frz-10.5\fax-0.02\fs15\pos(258,113)\c&HA99A98&}Free Margin
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:03.75,sign_Arial,text (5th line),0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\bord0\frz-10.5\fax-0.02\fs15\pos(289,135)\c&HA99A98&}Margin Level (%)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:03.75,sign_Arial,text (6th line),0,0,0,,{\an4\shad0\bord0\frz-10.5\fax-0.02\fs15\pos(185,132)\c&HA99A98&}Position
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.45,0:17:08.18,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,That's not worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:10.72,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I didn't go short for \Nmeasly earnings like these!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.72,0:17:12.93,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'll hold on to this short position.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:16.45,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,With gorilla-grip strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:19.68,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I swear I'll make mad profits!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:24.44,italics,narration,0,0,0,,The idea of retreat \Ndidn't even occur to Mebuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:32.22,italics,narration,0,0,0,,She perceived her delivery from an \Nextreme situation to be a divine miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:37.71,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Therefore, this drop in \NUSD/JPY was God's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:42.65,italics,narration,0,0,0,,She was convinced that, \Nas long as she believed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.65,0:17:44.75,italics,narration,0,0,0,,a great victory was sure to be hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.40,0:17:48.59,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Can't help this rise here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.59,0:17:51.46,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,If it suddenly drops too far, \Nit's gonna climb again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:54.76,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Don't be fooled by a temporary rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:57.42,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I've {\i0}got{\i1} to get my money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:02.81,sign_Arial,text (green),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H6C8A79&\bord0\shad0\move(100,59,100,44,1,146)\fad(146,1)}Incoming Message
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:02.81,sign_Arial,text (white),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs19\move(170,145,170,135,1,146)\c&H4B494E&\bord0\shad0\fad(146,1)}I went long on USD/JPY! Sixty lots fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.07,0:18:04.39,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:08.98,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Kurumi-senpai, you got \Ntricked into going long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:11.78,sign_Arial,text (green),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H6C8A79&\bord0\shad0\pos(99,46)}Incoming Message
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:11.78,sign_Arial,text (white),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs19\c&H4B494E&\bord0\shad0\fad(146,1)\pos(171,138)}USD/JPY, huh...? It does look like it'll climb...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:14.09,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,What?! You too, Yasuko-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:16.74,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:19.75,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,You mean that's what \Nbrought you over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:20.08,sign_Verdana,text (upper right),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H405050&\3c&HB7FDF4&\shad0\fs15}For Beginners!\N{\fs20\c&HF17963&\3c&HFFF6F1&} How to Draw {\c&HE2ACF6&}Viral Manga\N{\c&H3C3B3C&\fs15} Chunino Yoshiko\N{\c&H403E40&\3c&HF9F9F9&\fs15} Like\N{\3c&HA4F5EB&\fs20} I got 10,000 retweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.56,0:18:23.00,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,USD/JPY will probably climb, \Nbut I'm not buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:26.63,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I'm busy, unlike college students \Nwith all their free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:28.10,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:31.26,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,But I was worried you \Nmight incur another loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:33.04,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,No need to fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:36.01,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Are you saying you think \NUSD/JPY will fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:37.09,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It sure will!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.09,0:18:39.41,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I believe in staying short on USD/JPY!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.41,0:18:42.46,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,That position and I \Ncame through a crisis together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.46,0:18:46.29,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Hold on, you're already short? Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:48.39,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Since the start of last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.39,0:18:50.94,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Isn't that... before \Nit did that big climb?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:52.69,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,How strong a grip have you got?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:55.36,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Mebuki, take some friendly advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:57.32,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Cut yourself loose from that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:59.63,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Wh-What makes you say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:01.66,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Because you're being too emotional!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:04.09,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,If it goes up now, \Nyou're gonna lose everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.09,0:19:05.97,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,What would you know, Yasuko-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:09.43,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,You're more of a forex beginner \Nthan I am, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:14.90,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Uh, no, I actually got \Nstarted with it a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:16.73,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Don't bother trying to lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.73,0:19:18.78,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,You've never turned a single profit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:20.97,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Th-That part's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.97,0:19:24.40,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,but I don't want to see you \Nmake the same mistakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.09,0:19:27.57,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'll take it under advisement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.57,0:19:29.14,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Good luck with the manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.50,0:19:35.68,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,That fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.62,0:19:42.33,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Mebuki-chan? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.33,0:19:44.26,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'll get straight to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:46.58,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Which way do you think USD/JPY will move?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:48.39,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:50.34,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Let's take a quick look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:58.18,sign_Arial,text (top; pink),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H8F7BB6&\3c&HB299E4&\shad0\fs15}Speed Order\N{\c&H969790&\3c&H31322F&} Straddle Liquidate and Order Simultaneously\N{\c&H85828B&\3c&HBEBEBD&} Liquidate All\N{\c&HDCB6A2&\3c&HD85A2D&} Short Positions {\c&HA89FE3&\3c&H553EE3&}Long Positions\N{\c&HC3B19B&\3c&H85502A&} Open Volume\N Average Rate\N Profit/Loss (pips)\N Valuation Profit/Loss\N Trade Volume
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:54.57,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Is this severe drop due to panic selling?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.57,0:19:58.18,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Is the V-shaped recovery because \Nthey ran out of bagholders?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:20:01.65,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I can see the price climb slowed \Ndown when the festering stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.65,0:20:03.89,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,If I had to pick one, I'd go long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.89,0:20:06.35,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Hmm, this isn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:08.51,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,What's your take on it, Mebuki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.51,0:20:11.02,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I think it's still going to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:15.44,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,But Kurumi-senpai and Yasuko-chan \Nwere both saying it'd rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:18.83,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,So... is it going to rise?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:22.71,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Aha, she still has that shitty position.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:24.79,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,No, it'll drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.07,0:20:27.96,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Th-That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:30.96,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I'm with you on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:34.09,sign_Arial,text (top black; left),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HC2C6BC&\3c&H383739&\shad0}Straddle Liquidate and Order Simultaneously\N{\c&H272335&\3c&HAAA9AB&} Liquidate All\N{\c&H9A8778&\3c&HAE4221&} Short Positions {\c&HADAEC0&\3c&H422EC0&}Long Positions
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:33.59,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I'm going short on USD/JPY too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:36.37,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Just did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.37,0:20:38.46,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,That puts us on the same side!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:40.68,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,It sure does.
