Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:40.86,italics,narration,0,0,0,,On a random peaceful afternoon, there was \Nshocking news that rocked the markets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.64,0:21:49.18,italics,narration,0,0,0,,A giant blazing column emerged \Nin the USD/JPY market.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:22.62,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,M-M-Mochiko-senpai!
