Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.62,0:23:24.67,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,What is "panic selling"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.67,0:23:27.33,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,It's when a sudden market \Ndrop causes a panic,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.33,0:23:29.51,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,and people rush to liquidate positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:31.07,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Like you right now, Mebuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:34.64,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I-I'm as calm as a gorilla!
